[2m Assessment  [22mExplored the Bookshelf bookshop across all major flows: browsed catalog (4 books), added items to cart, manipulated quantities and removed items, completed checkout with order placement, and visited Orders, Account, and Sign-in pages. Identified 8 distinct defects: (1) Neuromancer shows negative inventory (-3), (2–5) cart total calculations persistently incorrect across multiple states ($14.00, $25.25, $53.25 shown instead of correct amounts), (6) cart quantity unexpectedly changed to 5 for Hyperion, (7) wrong item removed from cart (Hyperion disappeared when Solaris was removed), and (8) order confirmation displayed invalid epoch timestamp (1970-01-01) with impossible delivery date (1969-12-29). All core user flows have been exercised as chartered. The application is functionally navigable but has critical calculation and state management bugs in cart operations and order processing.

